  "prefLabel": "Ed 1128.07 Proration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1128.07 Proration. Pursuant to RSA 186-C:18, IX, when a child with a disability transfers from one responsible school district to another during the school year, the following shall apply to the proration of special education aid and emergency assistance among responsible districts:\n\n(a) Each district shall be reimbursed for only each school day on which the child was a resident of the district; and\n\n(b) Each district shall file separate application forms.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17; ss by #12601, eff 8-9-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1100.html"
